# Git intake gate
# Default: do not show newly created files unless they match the project allowlist.
# Tracked files are unaffected. To intentionally add a blocked artifact, use `git add -f <path>`.

*
!*/

# Root truth files
!.gitignore
!AGENTS.md
!PROJECT_STATE.md
!ENGINEERING_LOG.md
!DECISIONS.md
!PROJECT_TREE.md
!工程责任表-一期P0.md
!一期清单压实-接力总表.md
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!yarn.lock

# Source and schema folders
!admin/**/*.vue
!admin/**/*.ts
!admin/**/*.js
!admin/**/*.json
!admin/**/*.css
!admin/**/*.scss
!admin/**/*.html

!koaLite/**/*.js
!koaLite/**/*.json
!koaLite/**/*.sql
!koaLite/**/*.md

# Relay log keeps markdown only.
!副船长的航海接力日志/**/*.md

# Root design drafts (夏夏的设计稿/原型) — 放行根目录 html 和 md 设计文档
!/*.html
!/设计*.md
!/*说明*.md
!/侧边栏*.md

# Always block dependency/build/runtime/caches even though directories are traversable.
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.vite/
coverage/
/logs/
koaLite/logs/
koaLite/public/logs/
koaLite/start.log
.chat/
.claude/
.codex/
.codesight/
.aionrs/
.reasonix/
.ctx/cache/
.vscode/

# Secrets and local runtime state.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
koaLite/db/db.json
koaLite/db/init_db.js

# Binary/reference/material artifacts stay local by default.
*.zip
*.png
*.PNG
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.webp
*.bmp
*.ico
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.docx
*.doc
*.pptx
*.pdf
*.rar
*.7z
*.cmd
mini-program/
其他附件材料/
船长文件夹/

# OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
